  "problem": "On November 11th, 1918, an armistice was signed between the Germans and the Allies, ending World War I. Given that January 1st, 1918, was a Tuesday, use congruences to determine on which day of the week the war was over.\n\n*Hint: The year 1918 was not a leap year since it is not divisible by $4.$*",
